WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.890
King Jolliginki was very upset.

2
00:00:03.891 --> 00:00:07.573
"Bring the prisoners back!" he roared loudly.

3
00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:15.157
His guards, servants, and even poor Queen Ermintrude were sent out into the jungle.

4
00:00:15.158 --> 00:00:19.323
Dr. Dolittle and the animals could hear the guards behind them.

5
00:00:19.324 --> 00:00:21.889
"We'll get them!" one shouted.

6
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:26.361
"They're sure to get lost in our jungle!" cried another.

7
00:00:26.362 --> 00:00:31.964
"Let's put them back in the dungeon!" the guards roared.

8
00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:35.893
"What if they get us?" cried Dab-Dab and Gub-Gub.

9
00:00:35.894 --> 00:00:38.905
Jip growled at them, "Don't worry!

10
00:00:38.906 --> 00:00:46.897
Chee-Chee knows the jungle better than any human!"

11
00:00:46.898 --> 00:00:50.812
The doctor and the animals soon came to a crossroad.

12
00:00:50.813 --> 00:00:55.062
"Which way do we go, Chee-Chee?" asked the doctor.

13
00:00:55.063 --> 00:00:59.237
"This way," Chee-Chee pointed toward the dark shadows.

14
00:00:59.238 --> 00:01:02.482
Gub-Gub began crying.

15
00:01:02.483 --> 00:01:06.590
"I don't want to go that way."

16
00:01:06.591 --> 00:01:12.808
"Gub-Gub, you must learn to trust your friends," Dr. Dolittle said kindly.

17
00:01:12.809 --> 00:01:16.206
The pig still did not want to go.

18
00:01:16.207 --> 00:01:19.573
"Stay and get caught by Jolliginki's guards!

19
00:01:19.574 --> 00:01:23.545
I don't care!" growled Jip.

20
00:01:23.546 --> 00:01:24.734
"Jip is right.

21
00:01:24.735 --> 00:01:30.561
If you don't come with us, the king's guards will get you," said Dr. Dolittle.

22
00:01:30.562 --> 00:01:36.243
"I'll fly beside you, Gub-Gub," promised Polynesia.

23
00:01:36.244 --> 00:01:38.379
The hours passed quickly.

24
00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:42.072
There was no sign of the doctor or the animals.

25
00:01:42.073 --> 00:01:45.838
"Where did they go?" one guard asked.

26
00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:48.657
None of them were shouting anymore.

27
00:01:48.658 --> 00:01:57.308
The king would be very angry if the prisoners weren't found.

28
00:01:57.309 --> 00:01:59.642
Chee-Chee knew a hiding place.

29
00:01:59.643 --> 00:02:03.634
No man, not even the monkeys, knew about it.

30
00:02:03.635 --> 00:02:07.680
"What's happening?" Jip asked.

31
00:02:07.681 --> 00:02:14.747
"They're gone . . . for now," answered Chee-Chee.

32
00:02:14.748 --> 00:02:17.258
"What is it now, Gub-Gub?"

33
00:02:17.259 --> 00:02:20.708
Jip tried to make his voice sound nice.

34
00:02:20.709 --> 00:02:24.923
"I'm hungry," the pig replied.

35
00:02:24.924 --> 00:02:27.647
"Stay here. I'll get us some food,"

36
00:02:27.648 --> 00:02:31.211
Polynesia said and flew off.

37
00:02:31.212 --> 00:02:34.192
Polynesia knew the jungle very well.

38
00:02:34.193 --> 00:02:37.378
She found plenty of food and drinks for them.

39
00:02:37.379 --> 00:02:41.618
"What's that, Polynesia?" Gub-Gub pointed.

40
00:02:41.619 --> 00:02:43.187
"This is a coconut.

41
00:02:43.188 --> 00:02:47.756
It's really delicious," Polynesia answered.

42
00:02:47.757 --> 00:02:51.186
Polynesia flew up higher and higher.

43
00:02:51.187 --> 00:02:55.588
Then she dropped the coconut. SPLAT!

44
00:02:55.589 --> 00:02:59.532
"Drink the coconut milk," Dr. Dolittle told them.

45
00:02:59.533 --> 00:03:01.876
Soon it was time to leave the tree.

46
00:03:01.877 --> 00:03:03.276
"Come on, everyone!

47
00:03:03.277 --> 00:03:07.578
We must be on our way," Dr. Dolittle said.

48
00:03:07.579 --> 00:03:11.432
Back at the palace, the king was not happy at all.

49
00:03:11.433 --> 00:03:14.217
"How could they escape? How?

50
00:03:14.218 --> 00:03:18.030
This is MY jungle!" the king boomed.

51
00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:21.588
All the guards were afraid of the furious king.

52
00:03:21.589 --> 00:03:23.574
"Go back to the jungle!

53
00:03:23.575 --> 00:03:28.231
Don't return until you've found them!" the king commanded.

54
00:03:28.232 --> 00:03:34.110
Dr. Dolittle and the animals did not know the guards were still following them.

55
00:03:34.111 --> 00:03:39.485
"How much longer, Chee-Chee?" asked the very tired pig.

56
00:03:39.486 --> 00:03:44.187
"Soon, my friend. We are almost there," Chee-Chee replied.

57
00:03:44.188 --> 00:03:49.753
"At least we don't have to worry about the king's guards," Jip added.

58
00:03:49.754 --> 00:03:52.838
Everyone thought they were safe.

59
00:03:52.839 --> 00:03:58.131
Dr. Dolittle and the animals were very tired but they didn't stop.

60
00:03:58.132 --> 00:04:02.295
"We must help the monkeys," Dr. Dolittle kept saying.

61
00:04:02.296 --> 00:04:04.359
"But I'm so tired.

62
00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:10.403
I'm hungry and sleepy and . . . ," complained Gub-Gub.

63
00:04:10.404 --> 00:04:14.677
Suddenly, there was a noise from the trees.

64
00:04:14.678 --> 00:04:17.740
"What is it, Chee-Chee?" whispered the doctor.

65
00:04:17.741 --> 00:04:22.495
"I think we're being watched," Chee-Chee answered quietly.

66
00:04:22.496 --> 00:04:24.890
The trees moved again.

67
00:04:24.891 --> 00:04:27.506
Something was coming out toward them.

68
00:04:27.507 --> 00:04:30.801
"I'm scared," squeaked Gub-Gub.

69
00:04:30.802 --> 00:04:38.034
"So am I, Gub-Gub," the doctor replied.

